	(gr_text "0. Add ground cooper pour on whole board\n1. Add via-stiching on MCU part of board\n2. Check for issues with decoupling of STM32\n3. Add zenners (x4) and TVS (x8)\n4. Change buck to MP4320-2\n5. Check if any changes to Is pin (add op-amp if needed)\n6. Check for connection between channels planes\n7. Add cutouts for more screws\n8. Consider read-out of 3V3 and 5V ext supply"
